OL,3,GNEWSAJane Dodds standing down as Welsh
OL,4,ALiberal Democrats leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FJane Dodds has announced she will stand
OL,7,Fdown as leader of the Welsh Liberal
OL,8,FDemocrats.
OL,10,FDodds said she would remain the party's
OL,11,Fonly Member of the Senedd (MS), but
OL,12,Fthat work to increase its presence in
OL,13,FWales' parliament "should be led by a
OL,14,Fnew generation".
OL,16,F"Leading the Welsh Liberal Democrats
OL,17,Fhas been the honour of my life," she
OL,18,Fsaid in a statement on Tuesday, adding
OL,19,F"now is the right time" to hand over
OL,20,Fthe role.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
