OL,3,GNEWSAJane Dodds standing down as Welsh
OL,4,ALiberal Democrats leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnly Welsh Lib Dem MP David Chadwick is
OL,7,Feligible to seek nomination to replace
OL,8,FDodds at this stage, the party said.
